{"language":"jp","values":[["/skills/0/name_i18n/cn","浮空辉刃"],["/skills/0/name_i18n/jp","光輝の飛剣"],["/skills/0/simple_description_i18n/cn","召唤飞剑攻击敌人。"],["/skills/0/simple_description_i18n/jp","飛剣を召喚して敵を攻撃"],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","休召唤6把飞剑，接下来的普通攻击会控制这些飞剑攻击敌人，每把飞剑造成70% + 9% ATK伤害，持续8秒。"],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_i18n/jp","8秒間持続する「光輝の飛剣」状態に入る。「光輝の飛剣」状態の間、通常攻撃が「6本の飛剣を同時に飛ばして敵を攻撃」に変化。1本につき、敵に70% + 9% ATKのダメージを与える"],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":37,"end":42,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":71,"end":76,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":34,"end":46,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":68,"end":80,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","每把飞剑伤害提升至75% + 9% ATK。"],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_i18n/jp","飛剣1本ごとのダメージが75% + 9% ATKにUP"],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":12,"end":17,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_power_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":15,"end":20,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":9,"end":21,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":12,"end":24,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","每把飞剑伤害提升至80% + 9% ATK。"],["/skills/0/variants/2/description_i18n/jp","飛剣1本ごとのダメージが80% + 9% ATKにUP"],["/skills/0/variants/2/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":12,"end":17,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/0/variants/2/description_power_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":15,"end":20,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/0/variants/2/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":9,"end":21,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/2/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":12,"end":24,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/3/description_i18n/cn","每把飞剑伤害提升至85% + 9% ATK。"],["/skills/0/variants/3/description_i18n/jp","飛剣1本ごとのダメージが85% + 9% ATKにUP"],["/skills/0/variants/3/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":12,"end":17,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/0/variants/3/description_power_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":15,"end":20,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/0/variants/3/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":9,"end":21,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/3/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":12,"end":24,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/4/description_i18n/cn","每把飞剑伤害提升至90% + 9% ATK。"],["/skills/0/variants/4/description_i18n/jp","飛剣1本ごとのダメージが90% + 9% ATKにUP"],["/skills/0/variants/4/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":12,"end":17,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/0/variants/4/description_power_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":15,"end":20,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/0/variants/4/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":9,"end":21,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/4/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":12,"end":24,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/1/name_i18n/cn","重力坍塌"],["/skills/1/name_i18n/jp","重力崩壊"],["/skills/1/simple_description_i18n/cn","对敌人施加重力使其倒地，并引爆目标身上的剑魂。"],["/skills/1/simple_description_i18n/jp","敵に重力を与え、ノックダウンさせ、対象が持つ剣魂を一気に爆発させる"],["/skills/1/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","休使用普通攻击发射飞剑命中敌人时，会在敌人身上留下剑魂，休每进行4次普通攻击，下一次普通攻击会改为对持有剑魂最多的敌人释放“重力坍塌”，造成200% + 30% ATK伤害并使其倒地2秒，同时引爆敌人身上的所有剑魂，每道剑魂对该敌人额外附加36% + 3% ATK伤害。在“浮空辉刃”生效期间，“重力坍塌”的范围扩展至周围1格，并且会额外发射飞剑，造成6次48% + 6% ATK伤害。"],["/skills/1/variants/0/description_i18n/jp","通常攻撃で放った飛剣が敵にヒットした時、敵の体に剣魂を付与。通常攻撃を4回行うごとに、次の通常攻撃が「剣魂を最も多く持つ敵への重力崩壊」に変化：対象の敵に200% + 30% ATKのダメージを与え、2秒間ノックダウンさせ、対象が持つ剣魂を一気に爆発させる。爆発した剣魂1つにつき、追加で対象に36% + 3% ATKダメージを与える。「光輝の飛剣」状態の間、「重力崩壊」の範囲が周囲1マスに拡大し、さらに飛剣で敵に48% + 6% ATKのダメージを6回与える"],["/skills/1/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":74,"end":80,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"},{"start":123,"end":128,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg1"},{"start":181,"end":186,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg3"}]],["/skills/1/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":81,"end":87,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"},{"start":150,"end":155,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg1"},{"start":211,"end":216,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg3"}]],["/skills/1/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":70,"end":84,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":120,"end":132,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":178,"end":190,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/1/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":77,"end":91,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":147,"end":159,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":208,"end":220,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/1/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","“重力坍塌”伤害提升至220% + 30% ATK，“浮空辉刃”状态下每段伤害提升至52% + 6% ATK。"],["/skills/1/variants/1/description_i18n/jp","「重力崩壊」のダメージが220% + 30% ATKにUPし、「光輝の飛剣」状態の1回分の攻撃ダメージが52% + 6% ATKにUP"],["/skills/1/variants/1/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":15,"end":21,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"},{"start":45,"end":50,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg3"}]],["/skills/1/variants/1/description_power_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":16,"end":22,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"},{"start":55,"end":60,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg3"}]],["/skills/1/variants/1/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":11,"end":25,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":42,"end":54,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/1/variants/1/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":12,"end":26,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":52,"end":64,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/1/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","“重力坍塌”伤害提升至240% + 30% ATK，“浮空辉刃”状态下每段伤害提升至56% + 6% ATK。"],["/skills/1/variants/2/description_i18n/jp","「重力崩壊」のダメージが240% + 30% ATKにUPし、「光輝の飛剣」状態の1回分の攻撃ダメージが56% + 6% ATKにUP"],["/skills/1/variants/2/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":15,"end":21,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"},{"start":45,"end":50,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg3"}]],["/skills/1/variants/2/description_power_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":16,"end":22,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"},{"start":55,"end":60,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg3"}]],["/skills/1/variants/2/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":11,"end":25,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":42,"end":54,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/1/variants/2/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":12,"end":26,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":52,"end":64,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/1/variants/3/description_i18n/cn","“重力坍塌”伤害提升至260% + 30% ATK，“浮空辉刃”状态下每段伤害提升至60% + 6% ATK。"],["/skills/1/variants/3/description_i18n/jp","「重力崩壊」のダメージが260% + 30% ATKにUPし、「光輝の飛剣」状態の1回分の攻撃ダメージが60% + 6% ATKにUP"],["/skills/1/variants/3/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":15,"end":21,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"},{"start":45,"end":50,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg3"}]],["/skills/1/variants/3/description_power_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":16,"end":22,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"},{"start":55,"end":60,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg3"}]],["/skills/1/variants/3/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":11,"end":25,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":42,"end":54,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/1/variants/3/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":12,"end":26,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":52,"end":64,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/2/name_i18n/cn","淬火力场"],["/skills/2/name_i18n/jp","鍛剣の力場"],["/skills/2/simple_description_i18n/cn","布置力场强化飞剑。"],["/skills/2/simple_description_i18n/jp","飛剣を強化する力場を展開"],["/skills/2/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","战斗开始时，休在自身周围布置“淬火力场”，力场存在时，自身提升48点远程防御。休释放的飞剑穿过力场后将会获得强化，附带敌人最大生命值1.3% + 0.2%的真实伤害（最高不超过14% + 2% ATK）。力场会在自身位置变化后消失，并在自身位置连续不变3秒后重新生成。"],["/skills/2/variants/0/description_i18n/jp","戦闘開始時、自身の周囲に「鍛剣の力場」を展開。力場の存在期間中、自身の遠距離防御+48。自身が放った飛剣は、力場通過後に強化される：追加で敵にそのHP上限×1.3% + 0.2%の確定ダメージを与える（14% + 2% ATKを超えない）。自身の位置が変化すると、力場は消滅する。自身が同じ位置に連続3秒間留まると、力場が再び展開される"],["/skills/2/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":70,"end":77,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg1"},{"start":91,"end":96,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg2"}]],["/skills/2/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":82,"end":89,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg1"},{"start":104,"end":109,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg2"}]],["/skills/2/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":88,"end":100,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/2/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":101,"end":113,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/2/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","附加伤害提升至目标最大生命值的1.4% + 0.2%，最高不超过16% + 2% ATK。"],["/skills/2/variants/1/description_i18n/jp","追加の確定ダメージがHP上限×1.4% + 0.2%にUP、16% + 2% ATKを超えない"],["/skills/2/variants/1/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":19,"end":26,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg1"},{"start":35,"end":40,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg2"}]],["/skills/2/variants/1/description_power_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":19,"end":26,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg1"},{"start":33,"end":38,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg2"}]],["/skills/2/variants/1/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":32,"end":44,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/2/variants/1/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":30,"end":42,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/2/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","附加伤害提升至目标最大生命值的1.5% + 0.2%，最高不超过18% + 2% ATK。"],["/skills/2/variants/2/description_i18n/jp","追加の確定ダメージがHP上限×1.5% + 0.2%にUP、18% + 2% ATKを超えない"],["/skills/2/variants/2/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":19,"end":26,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg1"},{"start":35,"end":40,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg2"}]],["/skills/2/variants/2/description_power_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":19,"end":26,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg1"},{"start":33,"end":38,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg2"}]],["/skills/2/variants/2/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":32,"end":44,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/2/variants/2/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":30,"end":42,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/2/variants/3/description_i18n/cn","附加伤害提升至目标最大生命值的1.6% + 0.2%，最高不超过20% + 2% ATK。"],["/skills/2/variants/3/description_i18n/jp","追加の確定ダメージがHP上限×1.6% + 0.2%にUP、20% + 2% ATKを超えない"],["/skills/2/variants/3/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":19,"end":26,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg1"},{"start":35,"end":40,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg2"}]],["/skills/2/variants/3/description_power_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":19,"end":26,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg1"},{"start":33,"end":38,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg2"}]],["/skills/2/variants/3/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":32,"end":44,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/2/variants/3/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":30,"end":42,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/3/name_i18n/cn","英雄专精"],["/skills/3/name_i18n/jp","天賦の才"],["/skills/3/simple_description_i18n/cn","提升攻击速度。"],["/skills/3/simple_description_i18n/jp","攻撃速度UP"],["/skills/3/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","战斗中，自身的攻击速度提高21点。"],["/skills/3/variants/0/description_i18n/jp","戦闘中、自身の攻撃速度+21"],["/skills/3/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","战斗中，自身的攻击速度提高27点。"],["/skills/3/variants/1/description_i18n/jp","戦闘中、自身の攻撃速度+27"],["/skills/3/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","战斗中，自身的攻击速度提高33点。"],["/skills/3/variants/2/description_i18n/jp","戦闘中、自身の攻撃速度+33"],["/skills/4/name_i18n/cn","授勋仪式"],["/skills/4/name_i18n/jp","授勲式"],["/skills/4/simple_description_i18n/cn","自身获得友军施加的非永久属性提升时会获得能量和穿透，并提升双方的攻击速度。"],["/skills/4/simple_description_i18n/jp","味方による非永続的なステータス上昇効果を受けた時、SPを回復し、防御貫通UP、さらに、シューとその味方の攻撃速度UP"],["/skills/4/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","当自身获得一名友军施加的非永久属性提升效果时，休立刻回复300点能量，并永久提高4点穿透，此外还会使双方攻击速度均永久提升16点，该效果每名友军至多触发一次。"],["/skills/4/variants/0/description_i18n/jp","味方英雄から非永続的なステータス上昇効果を受けた時、シューのSPが300回復し、永続的に防御貫通+4、さらに永続的にシューとその味方の攻撃速度+16。この効果は味方1体につき、1回まで発動可能"],["/skills/4/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","休获得的穿透提高至6点。"],["/skills/4/variants/1/description_i18n/jp","シューの防御貫通の上昇量が6にUP"],["/skills/4/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","该效果触发2次后，休额外提升15%攻击力。"],["/skills/4/variants/2/description_i18n/jp","この効果が2回発動した後、さらにシューの攻撃力+15%"],["/skills/4/variants/3/description_i18n/cn","休获得的穿透提高至8点。"],["/skills/4/variants/3/description_i18n/jp","シューの防御貫通の上昇量が8にUP"],["/skills/5/name_i18n/cn","觉醒之力"],["/skills/5/name_i18n/jp","覚醒の力"],["/skills/5/simple_description_i18n/cn","休对高生命值比例的敌人造成更高伤害。"],["/skills/5/simple_description_i18n/jp","HP割合が高い敵への与ダメージUP"],["/skills/5/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","休在面对强力的敌人时能展现高昂的骑士精神，对当前生命值比例高于50%的敌人造成的伤害提升25%。"],["/skills/5/variants/0/description_i18n/jp","強大な敵と戦う時、騎士道精神を発揮し、現在HPの割合が50%より高い敵への与ダメージ+25%"],["/exclusive_equipment/name_i18n/cn","誓约之手"],["/exclusive_equipment/name_i18n/jp","誓いの手"]]}